;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote class="md-blockquote"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;註1：&lt;/strong&gt; 稽核可以是內部稽核（第一方）或外部稽核（第二方或第三方），可以是結合稽核（結合兩個或兩個以上學科）。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&#10; &lt;/blockquote&gt;&lt;h3 id="34-稽核範圍audit-scope"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#34-%e7%a8%bd%e6%a0%b8%e7%af%84%e5%9c%8daudit-scope" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.4 稽核範圍（Audit Scope）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="35-鑑別authentication"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#35-%e9%91%91%e5%88%a5authentication" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.5 鑑別（Authentication）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="36-真實性authenticity"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#36-%e7%9c%9f%e5%af%a6%e6%80%a7authenticity" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.6 真實性（Authenticity）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="37-可用性availability"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#37-%e5%8f%af%e7%94%a8%e6%80%a7availability" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.7 可用性（Availability）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="38-基本測度base-measure"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#38-%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e6%b8%ac%e5%ba%a6base-measure" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.8 基本測度（Base Measure）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="39-能力competence"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#39-%e8%83%bd%e5%8a%9bcompetence" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.9 能力（Competence）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="310-保密性confidentiality"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#310-%e4%bf%9d%e5%af%86%e6%80%a7confidentiality" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.10 保密性（Confidentiality）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="311-符合性conformity"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#311-%e7%ac%a6%e5%90%88%e6%80%a7conformity" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.11 符合性（Conformity）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;h3 id="312-後果consequence"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="#312-%e5%be%8c%e6%9e%9cconsequence" class="md-heading-anchor"&gt;&#10; 3.12 後果（Consequence）&#10; &lt;/a&gt;&#10;&lt;/h3&gt;&#10;&lt;blockquote class="md-blockquote"&gt;&#10; &lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;註1：&lt;/strong&gt; 一個事態可能導致一系列後果。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>PowerPoint 背景圖弄不到的話，右鍵調整版面配置</title><link>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/powerpoint-bakcground/</link><pubDate>Thu, 14 May 2026 22:34:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://tuobaling.github.io/blog/powerpoint-bakcground/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;如題&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;&lt;figure class="md-image"&gt;&#10; &lt;a href="https://prod-files-secure.s3.us-west-2.amazonaws.com/1dce5fdc-84b8-4a67-b95a-ebdee75d40c4/08751bb8-363d-47cf-b26b-6f74e0e23551/messageImage_1778769030702.jpg?X-Amz-Algorithm=AWS4-HMAC-SHA256&amp;amp;X-Amz-Content-Sha256=UNSIGNED-PAYLOAD&amp;amp;X-Amz-Credential=ASIAZI2LB466Z6XJ45JL%2F20260822%2Fus-west-2%2Fs3%2Faws4_request&amp;amp;X-Amz-Date=20260822T003008Z&amp;amp;X-Amz-Expires=3600&amp;amp;X-Amz-Security-Token=IQoJb3JpZ2luX2VjEOj%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FwEaCXVzLXdlc3QtMiJHMEUCIAnRkc1%2Fh7iSD6JGSXhDj7xPJ9G1Ty50zrWaqpp%2BvawKAiEA5teBDqRzRPHEqkU4A36AE%2BJrFot0%2BTYyUfe4bWQ6cB4qiAQIsf%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2F%2FARAAGgw2Mzc0MjMxODM4MDUiDP%2BQVYfc33iUZJT%2FSircA6e4WzoM9zBkf2o%2Bk3bqgiRcU9DjNWhFHwRfhHThArX4ECRZ0f63DdIaiiEHMnkA79pUa0YVFLTpWPEHECJSM6mbDELI3GqTLVrAhBs2JsD2GdLU2oriZpy5TM7x5SEPLoVC9846TGxoDMG0NG%2BDp%2FmP2kxh7Iw5Cgbq2YCOIO7m7pOnaldrgqa3i5Qw1hKnTa%2BX1TywEOkjnpA25R3Cr63ACx7lBhSXkVxC3IOTanbu1vd%2BzGswRfilRaLAAoefhFqCZn4KwwK0sA%2BzV7rncZ%2BTIv1dQGvgOGyV%2BVO5ZtW98%2BdApMTawxebAjW8Oc3PNeLjJMTgopqXLEP1RIWO8cv2DF29R9i069taZmrz4ygNE4i1WRzjWgD52FbyMp3FLWhk1WrMNj169vgtzbSy1%2Bcqt90WHQ627lNJ76q7QhBN50BiTS0eSqF%2FONZcuEXKVumUePadgAGGrgu5yZ5RdsKM6uI5yYwxQRf7gH7VXzoJRibi0px91O5LvF%2BFAT9hGBeudUnsgmHcaPuLC%2FW%2B0HpxVvlLgMdvV7udwHI0kCiU4AGDxXukETWTxLXol79%2BHmyH%2F7JaheRfasdnWHkkudeeeP2Fcj%2BWQph6Hf2hynUZrpTWF3cU6kP%2B2ITHMI7Go9QGOqUBBGY%2BtBrIW0289M3PqIgKlitWGMtOIhoaSEK6IKf2FCoYJ3BkB0qzyB%2FxSxlfzVtoYm1Mu6oHRqA5Ye7Z2O8ZLu0svuLgHDwkNlY0nm6JVH5PQleXQoqNMOAVQDgrMmWFN7jtIr7v1BQ3g28L5E4rwbjm%2BC4HuPgD5lKDKdqMHmLHZ%2BGme1pDTCpr3FOinjIc%2BkSvQVTnrgoEfPzoE%2FgkKYpXoTDj&amp;amp;X-Amz-Signature=c5841fcb9c86c67